# 🚦 Traffic Challan Automation

An AI-powered **Traffic Challan Automation System** designed to automate the process of detecting traffic violations, identifying vehicles, extracting vehicle information, and generating challan-related records.

The project aims to reduce manual work in traffic monitoring and improve the efficiency of traffic violation processing using **Computer Vision, OCR, Python, and automation**.

## 📌 Project Overview

Traditional traffic violation processing can require significant manual effort to identify vehicles, verify violations, read license plates, and maintain records.

This project provides an automated workflow where traffic-related images/videos can be processed to identify violations and extract relevant vehicle information.

### 🔄 Workflow

```text
Traffic Image / Video
        ↓
Image Processing
        ↓
Traffic Violation Detection
        ↓
Vehicle Detection
        ↓
Number Plate Detection
        ↓
OCR / Number Plate Recognition
        ↓
Vehicle Information Extraction
        ↓
Challan Record Generation
        ↓
Database / Output
```

## ✨ Features

* 🚗 Automated vehicle detection
* 🚦 Traffic violation detection
* 🔍 Number plate detection
* 🔤 OCR-based number plate text extraction
* 📄 Automated challan record generation
* 🗄️ Database integration for storing records
* 🐍 Python-based implementation
* ⚡ Reduces manual traffic-monitoring effort
* 📊 Structured output for further processing

